window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v27-023-5c337348b6c8c9ee.json"]={sha256:"5c337348b6c8c9ee4c70942a950b402e770104b658e35153c1e62ce3a5d4fa61",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-77ec1880d235c9b1","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/networking-ethernet-software/cumulus-linux/Layer-1-and-Switch-Ports/Quality-of-Service/","title":"Quality of Service","titleEn":"Quality of Service","publisher":"NVIDIA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-023","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-023","related":[{"id":"hpc-v27-024","referenceUrls":["https://docs.nvidia.com/networking-ethernet-software/cumulus-linux/Layer-1-and-Switch-Ports/Quality-of-Service/"],"title":"PFC watchdog：循環等待與阻塞佇列暴露","titleEn":"PFC watchdog: cyclic waits and blocked-queue exposure","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付集合成員表、兩組比例、固定分子反例與完整取樣範圍，讓同學能重建每個百分比；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver membership tables, both ratios, the fixed-numerator counterexample and full sampling scope. A learner must be able to reconstruct every percentage from identified packets or equivalent counter intervals. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"建立依賴邊與每佇列 byte_count；使用圖搜尋輸出循環成員，另外保留非循環但可能受阻的上游佇列。","differenceEn":"Build dependency edges and queue byte counts. Use graph traversal to identify cycle members, keeping upstream queues that may be indirectly stalled in a separate category rather than labeling them all part of the cycle.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["比例為同方向、同 class、同時間窗內 CE 標記封包除以可評估封包數；標記數不是位元組數也不是丟包數；兩組均有 1000 個 CE 標記封包；合格封包總數由 10000 改為 5000，無重置或取樣遺失；名義式 1000/10000*100 = 10 %；變更式 1000/5000*100 = 20 %。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","教學圖中只有位於有向循環的佇列算循環阻塞；暴露位元組為這些佇列的已排隊量總和；三個佇列 A→B→C→A，各排隊 64 KiB；變更移除 C→A，並假設末端能排空；名義式 3*64 = 192 KiB in cycles；變更式 0*64 = 0 KiB in cycles。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["The ratio divides CE-marked packets by eligible packets from the same direction, class and interval. Mark counts are not byte totals, drop counts or a direct measure of receiver throughput. Both fixtures have 1000 CE-marked packets. Eligible packet totals change from 10000 to 5000, with no counter reset or missing samples and with stable classification. Nominal 1000/10000*100 = 10 %; changed 1000/5000*100 = 20 %. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","In the teaching graph, only queues belonging to a directed cycle count as cyclically blocked. Exposed bytes are the queued bytes in those cycle members, not all traffic anywhere in the fabric. Start with A waiting for B, B for C and C for A, each holding 64 KiB. Remove C’s dependency on A and assume the terminal service can drain; all other queue sizes remain the initial snapshot. Nominal 3*64 = 192 KiB in cycles; changed 0*64 = 0 KiB in cycles. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v27-033","referenceUrls":["https://docs.daos.io/v3.0/overview/data_integrity/"],"title":"DAOS checksum：絕對位移對齊與觸碰區塊","titleEn":"DAOS checksums: absolute alignment and touched chunks","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付集合成員表、兩組比例、固定分子反例與完整取樣範圍，讓同學能重建每個百分比；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver membership tables, both ratios, the fixed-numerator counterexample and full sampling scope. A learner must be able to reconstruct every percentage from identified packets or equivalent counter intervals. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"建立 update_offset、length、chunk_size，輸出每個交集 chunk_id 與觸碰範圍；不把區塊數直接當實際讀取次數。","differenceEn":"Record update offset, length and chunk size, then emit each intersected chunk identifier and byte range. Chunk count is an alignment metric, not a claim about actual read operations or implementation-specific repair traffic.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["比例為同方向、同 class、同時間窗內 CE 標記封包除以可評估封包數；標記數不是位元組數也不是丟包數；兩組均有 1000 個 CE 標記封包；合格封包總數由 10000 改為 5000，無重置或取樣遺失；名義式 1000/10000*100 = 10 %；變更式 1000/5000*100 = 20 %。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","非空區間 [o,o+L) 觸碰區塊數為 ceil((o+L)/C)-floor(o/C)；零長度要獨立回傳零；checksum chunk 為 1024 B、更新長度 1024 B；名義起點 512 B，變更對齊為 0；名義式 ceil((512+1024)/1024)-floor(512/1024) = 2 checksum chunks touched；變更式 ceil((0+1024)/1024)-floor(0/1024) = 1 checksum chunks touched。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["The ratio divides CE-marked packets by eligible packets from the same direction, class and interval. Mark counts are not byte totals, drop counts or a direct measure of receiver throughput. Both fixtures have 1000 CE-marked packets. Eligible packet totals change from 10000 to 5000, with no counter reset or missing samples and with stable classification. Nominal 1000/10000*100 = 10 %; changed 1000/5000*100 = 20 %. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","For a nonempty interval [o,o+L), touched chunks equal ceiling((o+L)/C) minus floor(o/C). Handle zero length separately, since the nonempty formula can miscount an unaligned empty interval. Use 1024-byte checksum chunks and a 1024-byte update. Starting offset changes from 512 bytes to zero, while payload length and logical contents remain fixed. Nominal ceil((512+1024)/1024)-floor(512/1024) = 2 checksum chunks touched; changed ceil((0+1024)/1024)-floor(0/1024) = 1 checksum chunks touched. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-77ec1880d235c9b1","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/networking-ethernet-software/cumulus-linux/Layer-1-and-Switch-Ports/Quality-of-Service/","title":"Quality of Service","titleEn":"Quality of Service","publisher":"NVIDIA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-9c109e86a221b521","url":"https://docs.daos.io/v3.0/overview/data_integrity/","title":"DAOS data integrity","titleEn":"DAOS data integrity","publisher":"DAOS project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
